					</outline>
					<outline text="function writeUserDataFile (relpath, filedata, type, flPrivate, callback, options) { //3/24/24 by DW">
						<outline text="Changes" isComment="true">
							<outline text="4/26/24; 9:30:24 AM by DW">
								<outline text="It's time to get it to work with POST. See note on 3/28/24.">
								</outline>
							</outline>
							<outline text="4/5/24; 12:19:47 PM by DW">
								<outline text="New optional param, options, comes after the callback. Sorry. It's a late addition.">
								</outline>
							</outline>
							<outline text="3/28/24; 11:36:57 AM by DW">
								<outline text="I couldn't get anything back from the server via POST, so I'm trying GET. ">
								</outline>
								<outline text="It worked. I've been over it on both ends, can't see any difference between it and daveappserver which is what we use in feedland and drummer. ">
